config.updateaquaticbackport.fish.spawn=Natural Spawning
config.updateaquaticbackport.fish.spawn.tooltip=Fish spawn on their own in oceans and rivers, under their own mob cap of 20. Off, they come only from spawn eggs, spawners, commands and buckets.
