config.updateaquaticbackport.turtles.tooltip=Turtles, turtle eggs, scutes, the turtle shell and the Turtle Master potion.
config.updateaquaticbackport.dolphins.tooltip=Dolphins and Dolphin's Grace.
config.updateaquaticbackport.phantoms.tooltip=Phantoms, phantom membrane and Slow Falling.
config.updateaquaticbackport.trident.tooltip=The trident, its four enchantments, and the drowned.
config.updateaquaticbackport.conduit.tooltip=The conduit, Conduit Power, the nautilus shell and the heart of the sea.
config.updateaquaticbackport.structures.tooltip=Shipwrecks, ocean ruins, buried treasure and treasure maps.
config.updateaquaticbackport.oceans.tooltip=1.13's ocean biomes, icebergs, and underwater caves and ravines.
config.updateaquaticbackport.bubbles.tooltip=Bubble columns over soul sand and magma blocks.
config.updateaquaticbackport.blocks.tooltip=Smaller 1.13 block and item changes: prismarine stairs and slabs, carved pumpkins, wood blocks and more.
config.updateaquaticbackport.mobs.tooltip=1.13's changes to existing mobs.
config.updateaquaticbackport.water.tooltip=How water looks and feels: biome water colors, underwater fog, air refilling, floating items.
