config.updateaquaticbackport.turtles.spawnWeight.tooltip=How often turtles spawn on sandy beaches, against the other animals there (1.13: 5). 0 stops them spawning naturally.
config.updateaquaticbackport.turtles.spawnWeight=Beach Spawn Weight
config.updateaquaticbackport.dolphins.spawnWeight.tooltip=How often dolphins spawn in oceans, against the squid's 10. 0 stops natural spawning. Lukewarm and warm oceans get a fifth of this; cold and frozen oceans none.
config.updateaquaticbackport.dolphins.spawnWeight=Spawn Weight
config.updateaquaticbackport.phantoms.insomnia.tooltip=Phantoms spawn at night over players who have not slept for three days. Off, they never spawn on their own in any world; the doInsomnia game rule turns them off in one world.
config.updateaquaticbackport.phantoms.insomnia=Insomnia
config.updateaquaticbackport.trident.drownedSpawn.tooltip=Drowned spawn in oceans and rivers. Off, they come only from zombies that drown and from spawn eggs.
config.updateaquaticbackport.trident.drownedSpawn=Drowned Spawning
config.updateaquaticbackport.trident.impalingMobs.tooltip=Mobs Impaling counts as aquatic, by entity id, besides squid, guardians and every other water mob. Ids of mods that are not installed are ignored.
config.updateaquaticbackport.trident.impalingMobs=Impaling Mobs
config.updateaquaticbackport.trident.zombiesConvert.tooltip=A zombie underwater for 30 seconds turns into a drowned, and a husk into a zombie.
config.updateaquaticbackport.trident.zombiesConvert=Zombies Turn into Drowned
config.updateaquaticbackport.bubbles.generate=Form in New Chunks
config.updateaquaticbackport.bubbles.generate.tooltip=Bubble columns start over soul sand and magma blocks that world generation leaves under water, in newly generated chunks.
config.updateaquaticbackport.oceans.underwaterCaves=Underwater Caves and Ravines
config.updateaquaticbackport.oceans.underwaterCaves.tooltip=Underwater caves and ravines cut through ocean floors in newly generated chunks.
config.updateaquaticbackport.blocks.placementRules.tooltip=1.13's looser placement: pumpkins, jack o'lanterns and fence gates need no block under them, and doors can be placed against the side of a block.
config.updateaquaticbackport.blocks.placementRules=Looser Placement
config.updateaquaticbackport.water.biomeColors=Biome Water Colors
config.updateaquaticbackport.water.biomeColors.tooltip=1.13's water texture and its colors by biome: blue in most places, darker in cold biomes, purple in frozen ones, light green-gray in swamps, teal in warm oceans.
config.updateaquaticbackport.water.underwaterFog=Underwater Fog
config.updateaquaticbackport.water.underwaterFog.tooltip=1.13's view under water: fog in the biome's water color, darker deeper down, and clearer the longer you stay under.
config.updateaquaticbackport.water.ambience=Underwater Ambience
config.updateaquaticbackport.water.ambience.tooltip=Underwater ambience: a soft loop with bubbles and the odd distant sound while your head is under water.
config.updateaquaticbackport.water.lightThroughWater=Light Through Water
config.updateaquaticbackport.water.lightThroughWater.tooltip=Water dims light by 1 level per block instead of 3, so the sea floor is not pitch black. Light already worked out in existing chunks changes only where blocks change.
config.updateaquaticbackport.water.gradualAir=Gradual Air Refill
config.updateaquaticbackport.water.gradualAir.tooltip=Air comes back a little at a time after you surface, instead of all at once.
config.updateaquaticbackport.water.floatingItems=Floating Items and Orbs
config.updateaquaticbackport.water.floatingItems.tooltip=Dropped items and experience orbs float up in water instead of sinking. Checks every loaded item and orb once a tick.
config.updateaquaticbackport.water.shallowJump=Jump in Shallow Water
config.updateaquaticbackport.water.shallowJump.tooltip=Jumping in shallow flowing water is a normal jump instead of swimming up slowly.
config.updateaquaticbackport.mobs.undeadSink=Undead Sink
config.updateaquaticbackport.mobs.undeadSink.tooltip=Zombies, skeletons and their kinds, and skeleton and zombie horses, sink in water instead of swimming to the surface, and no undead mob drowns.
config.updateaquaticbackport.mobs.babyZombiesBurn=Baby Zombies Burn
config.updateaquaticbackport.mobs.babyZombiesBurn.tooltip=Baby zombies burn in daylight like adult ones.
config.updateaquaticbackport.mobs.squidInk=Squid Ink
config.updateaquaticbackport.mobs.squidInk.tooltip=A squid that is hurt squirts a cloud of ink and swims away from whatever hurt it.
config.updateaquaticbackport.mobs.polarBearsOnIce=Polar Bears on Ice
config.updateaquaticbackport.mobs.polarBearsOnIce.tooltip=Polar bears spawn on the ice of frozen oceans.
config.updateaquaticbackport.mobs.parrotsImitate=Parrots Imitate
config.updateaquaticbackport.mobs.parrotsImitate.tooltip=Parrots imitate phantoms and drowned when those mobs are in the game.
config.updateaquaticbackport.mobs.skeletonHorsesUnderwater=Skeleton Horses Underwater
config.updateaquaticbackport.mobs.skeletonHorsesUnderwater.tooltip=Skeleton horses keep their rider under water, move faster there than other horses, and make their own sounds under water.
